ear the front pillar\ntrim.</p><p>3. Disengage the pillar trim from the retainers using the special\ntool and move it aside slightly.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the bolt fixing the retaining band.</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connection for the tweeter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Left tweeter speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891059\">P45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Right tweeter speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891063\">P46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Keep the front pillar trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2061705.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cover is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ntweeter.</p><p>Position the retaining band and secure\nit using the bolt.</p><p>Engage the pillar trim on the retainers.</p><p>Fit the retaining button in place.</p><p>Fit t